    "- Notification – CRUD for Team & Project
Create
The system sends notifications to relevant members when a Team or Project is created, including the name, owner/manager, and creation timestamp.
Read
Members can view a list of notifications related to Teams and Projects, distinguish between unread and read statuses, and access notification details.
Update
The system sends notifications when a Team or Project is updated (such as changes to information, members, or status), clearly indicating the main changes.
Delete
The system sends notifications when a Team or Project is deleted, informing affected members of the impact and providing next steps if applicable.
Manage
Members can mark notifications as read or delete them for Team/Project CRUD actions; the system maintains notification history for audit and tracking purposes."
